{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714970/extras/stdemo1.png?t=1748640685\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are only 4 paths of knowledge in the demo version. You can play for 7 days in the demo version on normal difficulty. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The unlimited continue option will be added in the full version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714970/extras/stTemplate11.png?t=1748640685\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714970/extras/test.gif?t=1748640685\" />Kings of Cratia offers an experience that mixes real-time strategy and first-person shooter mechanics. Build your new village and manage your resources efficiently. Watch out for changing weather conditions. Be ready to defend your villages every day when night falls! RTS or FPS, you are free to protect your village the way you want it. You can also command your troops in FPS mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714970/extras/st2.png?t=1748640685\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714970/extras/test2.gif?t=1748640685\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every day at night, your village will be attacked by invaders. The number of attacking invaders increases with each new night. Develop new tactics against different types of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714970/extras/st3.png?t=1748640685\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714970/extras/test6.gif?t=1748640685\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each time you survive an invasion, you will be allowed to draw new cards. Choose one of the cards that you draw to get new power-ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714970/extras/st6.png?t=1748640685\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714970/extras/test3-2.gif?t=1748640685\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can unlock new special abilities by unlocking knowledge. You can use these special abilities in both modes, RTS and FPS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714970/extras/st4.png?t=1748640685\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714970/extras/test5.gif?t=1748640685\" />  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your resources carefully and efficiently. Be careful of the changing weather conditions. Get ready to defend your village every night!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game was created mostly by one person. Please feel free to share your thoughts.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3714970?t=1748640685","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3714970?t=1748640685","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714970/31187f68cae8671932e2ce0559ca4779cc47f831/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748640685","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714970/31187f68cae8671932e2ce0559ca4779cc47f831/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748640685","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game is about the player establishing a new kingdom from scratch in the middle ages. Player fights with his army and the player's own character. Player can kill enemies with weapons such as swords, bows and axes."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714970/extras/stdemo1.png?t=1748640685\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are only 4 paths of knowledge in the demo version. You can play for 7 days in the demo version on normal difficulty. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The unlimited continue option will be added in the full version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714970/extras/stTemplate11.png?t=1748640685\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714970/extras/test.gif?t=1748640685\" />Kings of Cratia offers an experience that mixes real-time strategy and first-person shooter mechanics. Build your new village and manage your resources efficiently. Watch out for changing weather conditions. Be ready to defend your villages every day when night falls! RTS or FPS, you are free to protect your village the way you want it. You can also command your troops in FPS mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714970/extras/st2.png?t=1748640685\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714970/extras/test2.gif?t=1748640685\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every day at night, your village will be attacked by invaders. The number of attacking invaders increases with each new night. Develop new tactics against different types of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714970/extras/st3.png?t=1748640685\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714970/extras/test6.gif?t=1748640685\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each time you survive an invasion, you will be allowed to draw new cards. Choose one of the cards that you draw to get new power-ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714970/extras/st6.png?t=1748640685\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714970/extras/test3-2.gif?t=1748640685\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can unlock new special abilities by unlocking knowledge. You can use these special abilities in both modes, RTS and FPS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714970/extras/st4.png?t=1748640685\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714970/extras/test5.gif?t=1748640685\" />  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your resources carefully and efficiently. Be careful of the changing weather conditions. Get ready to defend your village every night!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game was created mostly by one person. Please feel free to share your thoughts.</p>","developers":["eniscoskun"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3594980","name":"Kings of Cratia"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714970/c80877d1a9c3afa2e864703cf81b7c3908479026/header.jpg?t=1748640685","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"